WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:03.456
Maria keeps the passwords her family will need

2
00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:04.432
in one place.

3
00:00:06.046 --> 00:00:09.016
From her plan, it is one click away in

4
00:00:09.016 --> 00:00:09.727
Settings.

5
00:00:14.551 --> 00:00:18.126
It is encrypted with a key that is hers alone.

6
00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:20.029
The list shows names only.

7
00:00:20.029 --> 00:00:22.150
Each one says who can see it,

8
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.189
and from when.

9
00:00:24.195 --> 00:00:27.263
She adds the card her son uses for the

10
00:00:27.263 --> 00:00:28.076
groceries.

11
00:00:35.027 --> 00:00:38.274
Sharing is a choice she makes for each secret,

12
00:00:38.274 --> 00:00:40.268
now or only after her death.

13
00:00:41.883 --> 00:00:45.134
This one, her son can open from today.

14
00:00:46.142 --> 00:00:48.869
A value only shows when she asks for it,

15
00:00:48.869 --> 00:00:51.676
and it hides itself again after a minute.

16
00:00:53.316 --> 00:00:55.465
And every look is on record.

17
00:00:55.465 --> 00:00:58.845
Here is the day Lucas opened the bank login.

18
00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:02.868
Her notes say what to do. Now they can point

19
00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:04.376
at the right password.

20
00:01:08.095 --> 00:01:12.370
She types an at sign, and her secrets appear.

21
00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:15.199
One click, and the card is in the note.

22
00:01:15.199 --> 00:01:17.521
Only its name, never the number.

23
00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:24.605
And all her secrets sit right next to her notes.

24
00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:32.293
Lucas, her son, opens his mother's plan from

25
00:01:32.293 --> 00:01:33.568
his own account.

26
00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:36.905
He sees only what she shared with him today.

27
00:01:36.905 --> 00:01:40.680
And Maria's history gets a line with his name.

28
00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:47.259
Ana is a trusted contact too,

29
00:01:47.259 --> 00:01:50.223
but Maria never let her see secrets.

30
00:01:51.565 --> 00:01:54.410
She can read the note and see which secret it

31
00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.944
means. There is nothing for her to open.
